{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51588","headline":"献诗吴越王（句） · 陶谷","name":"献诗吴越王（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶谷又尝奉使两浙，献诗二十韵於钱俶，其末云云。\n时谷官是丞郎，职爲学士，奉命小邦，献诗已是失体，复有扫门之句，何辱命之甚也。\n此生头已白，无路扫王门。\n（《国老谈苑》一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}